            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='241' forceUpdate='true' h='13833' id='84' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='25929' x='74285' y='29722'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>•  Contract type is the strongest structural driver.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>•  Tenure and pricing effects become significantly stronger under Month-to-Month contracts.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>•  Long-term contracts substantially reduce churn risk, even among high-price customers.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>•  High-risk customers are more vulnerable to common churn triggers such as competitor offers and service dissatisfaction.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='103' h='5722' id='86' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='25929' x='74285' y='43555'>
            <zone h='5722' id='87' is-scaled='1' param='/Users/yangpeiqi/Documents/My Tableau Repository/Shapes/Telecom/inovation.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='4215' x='74285' y='43555'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
